_publ_section_title
;
 Benzylation and nitrosation of
 4-amino-2-(methylsulfanyl)pyrimidin-6(1<i>H</i>)-one: two
 <i>P</i>2~1~/<i>c</i> polymorphs of
 4-amino-1-benzyl-2-(methylsulfanyl)pyrimidin-6(1<i>H</i>)-one with
 <i>Z</i>'=1 and 2, 4-amino-6-benzyloxy-2-(methylsulfanyl)pyrimidine
 and
 4-amino-1-benzyl-2-(methylsulfanyl)-5-nitrosopyrimidin-6(1<i>H</i>)-one
 all give different hydrogen-bonded supramolecular structures
;
